                                "sense_id": "7b5977ce-e786-3921-9653-507723164317",
                                "text": "Then she looked at Paragot and the child, a yard or two in front of us. \"He is the image of his father,\" she said almost reverentially. […] \"Pauvre chéri,\" said Blanquette, motherwise."
                            }
